1659.description:
Remember the thrill of mini-racing games? It was a huge project, and now we have great news for you, in a game called Table Top Racing: World Tour. What's so exciting about another race? Well, this project revives the spirit of the old game, offering a chance to race mini-cars in unpredictable competition. This time, you'll have access to brand-new racing locations, and you can now compete online and challenge up to eight people at a time. And that's not all this adventure has to offer, so to learn everything you need to know about the game, simply download Table Top Racing: World Tour for free via torrent.

Game features:
- extensive multiplayer mode with the ability to connect up to 8 players;
- about 6 game modes will be available;
- The developers have created 86 challenges that will test your driving skills;
- about 20 racing tracks have been created, which are divided into 5 thematic locations;
- 12 original and iconic mini-cars are available, each with its own features and appearance;
- 8 types of weapons and 6 powerful bonuses will be available during the competition, capable of radically changing the course of the competition;
- 20 unforgettable music tracks from iconic producers of this genre.

2506.description:
The horrific Second World War gave rise to countless legends, and science fiction writers dreamed up countless tales in the wake of universal horror and tyranny. Now, players can immerse themselves in the adventures of NecroVision and see what would have happened if German troops had gained control of demonic power. While it might not be as pleasant, let's not forget the protagonist, who also fell victim to demonic influence and now intends to use his power against the resurgent dark forces. An unforgettable encounter awaits, along with unusual and versatile combat skills and, of course, unprecedented weaponry from the dark side of life. Sounds less exciting than you'd hoped? Then it's time to dive into the game yourself and achieve victory.

NecroVision is a first-person shooter that offers a fictional yet compelling story set during World War II. We're confident you'll achieve victory and vanquish your demons, but don't think success will come so easily. Take advantage of your new abilities, upgrade your weapons, and strive for success. We believe you'll succeed and survive this sea of ​​horror and fear.

Repack Features:
- Nothing cut/recoded;
- Game versions: NecroVisioN - 1.2; NecroVisioN: Lost Company - 1.1;
- Possibility to choose a combination of text and voice-over.
